{"step_index":824,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T09:15:43Z","thinking":"**Analyzing HTML Content**\n\nI'm currently dissecting the `index.html` document. It seems to have inline CSS and JavaScript fixes embedded directly within it for dynamic patching. I'm focusing on the IIFE within the `<script id=\"runtime-hotfix-js\">` tag to understand its role in this system.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"vi\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=3.0, user-scalable=yes, viewport-fit=cover\">\n    <title>Cùng Bé Bin Đi Máy Bay (13 Hoạt Động Kỹ Năng Độc Lập - Master Storybook UI)</title>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@700;800;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/style.css\">\n\n<style id=\"runtime-hotfix-css\">\n/* ===== HOTFIX SHELL ===== */\n.hidden { display: none !important; }\n.activity-container { display: none; }\n.activity-container.active { display: block; }\n.activity-intro-view.hidden,\n.activity-gameplay-view.hidden,\n.activity-feedback-overlay.hidden { display: none !important; }\n\n.parent-modal-overlay {\n  display: none;\n  position: fixed;\n  inset: 0;\n  z-index: 9999;\n  background: rgba(22,34,49,.55);\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 18px;\n}\n.parent-modal-overlay.open { display: flex; }\n.parent-control-card {\n  width: min(720px, 94vw);\n  max-height: 88vh;\n  overflow: auto;\n  background: #fff;\n  border-radius: 24px;\n  padding: 18px;\n  box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.25);\n}\n.golden-medal-modal {\n  display: none;\n  position: fixed;\n  inset: 8% 10%;\n  z-index: 9000;\n  background: rgba(255,255,255,.97);\n  border-radius: 28px;\n  padding: 20px;\n  text-align: center;\n  box-shadow: 0 20px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.28);\n}\n.golden-medal-modal.show { display: block; }\n\n.stage-dot.locked { opacity: .38; cursor: not-allowed; filter: grayscale(1); }\n.stage-dot.completed { opacity: .9; }\n.stage-dot.active { opacity: 1; filter: none; }\n\n.asset-load-error {\n  display:flex;\n  align-items:center;\n  justify-content:center;\n  min-height:140px;\n  border:2px dashed #d66;\n  background:#fff7f7;\n  color:#9d2929;\n  border-radius:16px;\n  padding:12px;\n  font:700 14px/1.4 system-ui,sans-serif;\n  text-align:center;\n}\n\n#bin-character-mount-lvl1 {\n  position: relative;\n  min-width: 180px;\n  min-height: 300px;\n}\n.bin-runtime-base,\n.bin-runtime-layer {\n  position:absolute;\n  left:50%;\n  transform:translateX(-50%);\n  object-fit:contain;\n  pointer-events:none;\n}\n.bin-runtime-base {\n  inset:0;\n  width:100%;\n  height:100%;\n}\n.bin-runtime-layer.shirt { width:48%; top:31%; z-index:3; }\n.bin-runtime-layer.pants { width:46%; top:55%; z-index:4; }\n.bin-runtime-layer.shoes { width:52%; top:78%; z-index:5; }\n\n.runtime-selected {\n  outline: 4px solid #4caf50 !important;\n  transform: scale(1.03);\n}\n.runtime-packed {\n  opacity:.35;\n  pointer-events:none;\n}\n.xray-item-tile.runtime-checked {\n  outline:4px solid #4caf50;\n  border-radius:14px;\n}\n.gate-hud-btn.runtime-correct {\n  background:#c8f7d1 !important;\n  border-color:#2e7d32 !important;\n}\n.real-suitcase-card.runtime-wrong {\n  animation: runtimeShake .25s linear 2;\n}\n@keyframes runtimeShake {\n  0%,100%{transform:translateX(0)}\n  50%{transform:translateX(8px)}\n}\n</style>\n\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div id=\"app-root\">\n        <!-- Canvas Pháo hoa, Sao lấp lánh & Trái tim -->\n        <canvas id=\"effects-canvas\"></canvas>\n\n        <!-- TẦNG 1: TOP BAR - 8 CHẶNG LỚN & CỔNG BA MẸ -->\n        <header class=\"top-nav\">\n            <nav class=\"stage-indicators\" aria-label=\"Tiến trình 8 chặng chuyến bay\">\n                <button class=\"stage-dot active\" data-stage=\"1\" aria-label=\"Chặng 1: Chuẩn bị trang phục\">👕</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-stage=\"2\" aria-label=\"Chặng 2: Xếp hành lý\">🧳</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-stage=\"3\" aria-label=\"Chặng 3: Kiểm tra an ninh\">🎫</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-stage=\"4\" aria-label=\"Chặng 4: Tìm Cổng Bay\">🚪</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-stage=\"5\" aria-label=\"Chặng 5: Ngồi trên máy bay\">🦸</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-stage=\"6\" aria-label=\"Chặng 6: Ngắm mây\">☁️</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-stage=\"7\" aria-label=\"Chặng 7: Lịch sự\">🤫</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-stage=\"8\" aria-label=\"Chặng 8: Hạ cánh & Nhận vali\">🏆</button>\n            </nav>\n\n            <!-- Cổng Ba Mẹ (Giữ 3 giây để mở) -->\n            <button id=\"btn-parent-gate\" class=\"tycoon-btn parent-gate-btn\" aria-label=\"Cổng Ba Mẹ (Giữ 3 giây)\">\n                <svg class=\"parent-hold-ring\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\">\n                    <circle id=\"parent-ring-circle\" cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"26\"></circle>\n                </svg>\n                ⚙️ <span>Ba Mẹ</span>\n            </button>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- TẦNG 2: TIẾN TRÌNH PHỤ & LỜI THOẠI BA MẸ ĐỌC -->\n        <div class=\"parent-prompt-container\">\n            <div id=\"sub-progress-bar\" class=\"sub-progress-bar\">\n                <span id=\"sub-progress-text\">Chặng 1 — Hoạt động 1: Chọn trang phục</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"parent-prompt-signboard\">\n                <div id=\"parent-prompt-avatar\" class=\"prompt-avatar-badge\">👩</div>\n                <span id=\"parent-prompt-text\" class=\"prompt-speech-text\">“Bin sắp đi máy bay rồi. Con chọn bộ đồ nào giúp Bin dễ vận động nhé!”</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- TẦNG 3: VIEWPORT 13 HOẠT ĐỘNG ĐỘC LẬP -->\n        <main class=\"screens-viewport\">\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 CHẶNG 1 — HOẠT ĐỘNG 1: CHỌN TRANG PHỤC THOẢI MÁI\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"act-1\" class=\"activity-container active\" data-act=\"1\" data-stage=\"1\">\n                <div class=\"activity-intro-view\" id=\"intro-act-1\">\n                    <span class=\"intro-header-badge\">CHẶNG 1 — HOẠT ĐỘNG 1</span>\n                    <h2 class=\"intro-activity-title\">CHỌN TRANG PHỤC THOẢI MÁI</h2>\n                    <div class=\"intro-art-frame\">\n                        <img id=\"intro-art-act-1\" src=\"assets/scenes/intro_act1_wardrobe.svg\" alt=\"Bé Bin đứng trước tủ quần áo trong phòng ngủ\">\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"intro-prompt-quote\">Mẹ: “Bin sắp đi máy bay rồi. Con chọn bộ đồ nào giúp Bin dễ vận động nhé!”</p>\n                    <button class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-primary btn-start-activity\" data-act=\"1\" style=\"font-size: 17px; padding: 8px 28px;\">\n                        BẮT ĐẦU HOẠT ĐỘNG 🚀\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"activity-gameplay-view hidden\" id=\"gameplay-act-1\">\n                    <div class=\"level1-room-scene\">\n                        <!-- Tủ quần áo bên trong căn phòng -->\n                        <div class=\"room-wardrobe-grid\">\n                            <button class=\"clothes-tile-item\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"soft\" data-type=\"shirt\">\n                                <img src=\"assets/objects/shirt_soft.svg\" alt=\"Áo thun mềm\">\n                                <span>Áo thun mềm</span>\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"clothes-tile-item\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"stiff\" data-type=\"jeans\">\n                                <img src=\"assets/objects/jeans_stiff.svg\" alt=\"Quần bò cứng\">\n                                <span>Quần bò cứng</span>\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"clothes-tile-item\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"soft\" data-type=\"pants\">\n                                <img src=\"assets/objects/pants_soft.svg\" alt=\"Quần thun mềm\">\n                                <span>Quần thun mềm</span>\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"clothes-tile-item\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"stiff\" data-type=\"dress\">\n                                <img src=\"assets/objects/outfit_onepiece.svg\" alt=\"Bộ yếm rườm rà\">\n                                <span>Bộ yếm rườm rà</span>\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"clothes-tile-item\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"soft\" data-type=\"shoes\">\n                                <img src=\"assets/objects/shoes_velcro.svg\" alt=\"Giày dán xé\">\n                                <span>Giày dán xé</span>\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"clothes-tile-item\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"stiff\" data-type=\"boots\">\n                                <img src=\"assets/objects/boots_laces.svg\" alt=\"Bốt cao cổ\">\n                                <span>Bốt cao cổ</span>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Bé Bin đứng trực tiếp trong căn phòng ngủ -->\n                        <div class=\"room-bin-character-mount\">\n                            <div id=\"bin-character-mount-lvl1\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%;\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"activity-feedback-overlay hidden\" id=\"feedback-act-1\">\n                        <span class=\"feedback-text\">Mẹ: “Bin sẵn sàng rồi! Mình đi xếp vali nhé!”</span>\n                        <button class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green btn-next-activity\" data-next=\"2\">\n                            TIẾP TỤC 🧳 ➡️\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 CHẶNG 2 — HOẠT ĐỘNG 2: XẾP ĐỒ VÀO VALI\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"act-2\" class=\"activity-container\" data-act=\"2\" data-stage=\"2\" style=\"background-image: url('assets/backgrounds/bg_packing.svg');\">\n                <div class=\"activity-intro-view\" id=\"intro-act-2\">\n                    <span class=\"intro-header-badge\">CHẶNG 2 — HOẠT ĐỘNG 2</span>\n                    <h2 class=\"intro-activity-title\">XẾP ĐỒ VÀO VALI</h2>\n                    <div class=\"intro-art-frame\">\n                        <img src=\"assets/scenes/intro_act2_packing.svg\" alt=\"Bé Bin và Bố xếp đồ vào vali\">\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"intro-prompt-quote\">Bố: “Bin mang gì đi máy bay nhỉ? Con xếp vali giúp Bin nhé!”</p>\n                    <button class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-primary btn-start-activity\" data-act=\"2\" style=\"font-size: 17px; padding: 8px 28px;\">\n                        BẮT ĐẦU HOẠT ĐỘNG 🚀\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"activity-gameplay-view hidden\" id=\"gameplay-act-2\">\n                    <div class=\"suitcase-arena\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 20px; width: 100%; height: 86%;\">\n                        <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\">\n                            <button class=\"clothes-tile-item\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"PACK\">\n                                <img src=\"assets/objects/teddy_bear.svg\" alt=\"Gấu bông\">\n                                <span>Gấu bông</span>\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"clothes-tile-item\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"PACK\">\n                                <img src=\"assets/objects/shirt_soft.svg\" alt=\"Quần áo mềm\">\n                                <span>Quần áo</span>\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"clothes-tile-item\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"LEAVE_HOME\">\n                                <img src=\"assets/objects/scissors_art.svg\" alt=\"Kéo nhọn\">\n                                <span>Kéo nhọn</span>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div id=\"suitcase-target-lvl2\" class=\"suitcase-box-red\" style=\"width: 280px; height: 350px; background-image: url('assets/objects/red_suitcase.svg'); background-size: contain; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: center; position: relative;\">\n                            <div id=\"suitcase-inner-lvl2\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 40px 30px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 6px; align-items: center; justify-items: center;\"></div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\">\n                            <button class=\"clothes-tile-item\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"PACK\">\n                                <img src=\"assets/objects/toothbrush_art.svg\" alt=\"Bàn chải\">\n                                <span>Bàn chải</span>\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"clothes-tile-item\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"ASK_PARENT\">\n                                <img src=\"assets/objects/water_bottle_large.svg\" alt=\"Bình lớn\">\n                                <span>Bình lớn</span>\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"clothes-tile-item\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"PACK\">\n                                <img src=\"assets/objects/sunhat_art.svg\" alt=\"Mũ che nắng\">\n                                <span>Mũ che nắng</span>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"activity-feedback-overlay hidden\" id=\"feedback-act-2\">\n                        <span class=\"feedback-text\">Mẹ: “Vali của Bin sẵn sàng rồi! Đến sân bay thôi!”</span>\n                        <button class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green btn-next-activity\" data-next=\"3\">\n                            ĐẾN SÂN BAY 🚗 ➡️\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 CHẶNG 3 — HOẠT ĐỘNG 3: KIỂM TRA VÉ (BẢN VÉ MÁY BAY MỚI CHUẨN ARTWORK)\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"act-3\" class=\"activity-container\" data-act=\"3\" data-stage=\"3\" style=\"background-image: url('assets/backgrounds/bg_security.svg');\">\n                <div class=\"activity-intro-view\" id=\"intro-act-3\">\n                    <span class=\"intro-header-badge\">CHẶNG 3 — HOẠT ĐỘNG 3</span>\n                    <h2 class=\"intro-activity-title\">KIỂM TRA VÉ & THẺ LÊN MÁY BAY</h2>\n                    <div class=\"intro-art-frame\">\n                        <img src=\"assets/scenes/boarding_pass_scene.svg\" alt=\"Kiểm tra vé\">\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"intro-prompt-quote\">Mẹ: “Đến quầy kiểm tra rồi. Con giúp Bin đưa vé nhé!”</p>\n                    <button class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-primary btn-start-activity\" data-act=\"3\" style=\"font-size: 17px; padding: 8px 28px;\">\n                        BẮT ĐẦU HOẠT ĐỘNG 🚀\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"activity-gameplay-view hidden\" id=\"gameplay-act-3\">\n                    <div class=\"unified-scene-stage\" id=\"boarding-pass-stage-3\" style=\"cursor: pointer; position: relative;\">\n                        <img id=\"scene-img-act-3\" class=\"unified-scene-img\" src=\"assets/scenes/boarding_pass_scene.svg\" alt=\"Vé máy bay Bé Bin\">\n\n                        <div class=\"scene-interactive-hud\">\n                            <button id=\"btn-show-ticket-3\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-primary\" style=\"font-size: 16px; padding: 8px 22px;\">\n                                🎫 Chạm vào vé để kiểm tra & đóng dấu\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"activity-feedback-overlay hidden\" id=\"feedback-act-3\">\n                        <span class=\"feedback-text\">Tiếp viên: “Vé của Bin xong rồi! Giờ soi chiếu vali nhé.”</span>\n                        <button class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green btn-next-activity\" data-next=\"4\">\n                            SOI HÀNH LÝ 📦 ➡️\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 CHẶNG 3 — HOẠT ĐỘNG 4: SOI HÀNH LÝ QUA MÁY QUÉT (ARTWORK THẬT)\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"act-4\" class=\"activity-container\" data-act=\"4\" data-stage=\"3\" style=\"background-image: url('assets/backgrounds/bg_security.svg');\">\n                <div class=\"activity-intro-view\" id=\"intro-act-4\">\n                    <span class=\"intro-header-badge\">CHẶNG 3 — HOẠT ĐỘNG 4</span>\n                    <h2 class=\"intro-activity-title\">SOI HÀNH LÝ QUA MÁY QUÉT</h2>\n                    <div class=\"intro-art-frame\">\n                        <img src=\"assets/scenes/intro_act4_xray.svg\" alt=\"Bin quan sát vali qua máy soi\">\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"intro-prompt-quote\">Bố: “Bây giờ vali của Bin sẽ đi qua máy soi. Con xem bên trong có gì nhé!”</p>\n                    <button class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-primary btn-start-activity\" data-act=\"4\" style=\"font-size: 17px; padding: 8px 28px;\">\n                        BẮT ĐẦU HOẠT ĐỘNG 🚀\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"activity-gameplay-view hidden\" id=\"gameplay-act-4\">\n                    <div class=\"xray-focused-arena\">\n                        <div class=\"xray-scanner-chunky\">\n                            <span style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 15px; color: #00897B;\">MÀN HÌNH SOI CHIẾU AN NINH X-RAY</span>\n                            <div class=\"xray-screen-art-grid\">\n                                <div class=\"xray-item-tile\" data-name=\"Gấu bông\">\n                                    <img src=\"assets/objects/teddy_bear.svg\" alt=\"Gấu bông\">\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"xray-item-tile\" data-name=\"Quần áo\">\n                                    <img src=\"assets/objects/shirt_soft.svg\" alt=\"Quần áo\">\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"xray-item-tile\" data-name=\"Mũ che nắng\">\n                                    <img src=\"assets/objects/sunhat_art.svg\" alt=\"Mũ che nắng\">\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #004D40;\">Chạm vào các vật trong vali để kiểm tra an toàn</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"activity-feedback-overlay hidden\" id=\"feedback-act-4\">\n                        <span class=\"feedback-text\">Mẹ: “Vali của Bin an toàn rồi! Qua cổng kiểm tra nhé!”</span>\n                        <button class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green btn-next-activity\" data-next=\"5\">\n                            QUA CỔNG AN NINH 🚪 ➡️\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 CHẶNG 3 — HOẠT ĐỘNG 5: ĐI QUA CỔNG AN NINH (UNIFIED SCENE ART)\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"act-5\" class=\"activity-container\" data-act=\"5\" data-stage=\"3\">\n                <div class=\"activity-intro-view\" id=\"intro-act-5\">\n                    <span class=\"intro-header-badge\">CHẶNG 3 — HOẠT ĐỘNG 5</span>\n                    <h2 class=\"intro-activity-title\">ĐI QUA CỔNG AN NINH</h2>\n                    <div class=\"intro-art-frame\">\n                        <img src=\"assets/scenes/intro_act5_gate.svg\" alt=\"Bin đi qua cổng an ninh\">\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"intro-prompt-quote\">Mẹ: “Đến cổng an ninh rồi. Con giúp Bin đi qua nhé!”</p>\n                    <button class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-primary btn-start-activity\" data-act=\"5\" style=\"font-size: 17px; padding: 8px 28px;\">\n                        BẮT ĐẦU HOẠT ĐỘNG 🚀\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"activity-gameplay-view hidden\" id=\"gameplay-act-5\">\n                    <div class=\"unified-scene-stage\">\n                        <img id=\"scene-img-act-5\" class=\"unified-scene-img\" src=\"ass