      </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"activity-gameplay-view hidden\" id=\"gameplay-act-6\">\n                    <div class=\"unified-scene-stage\">\n                        <img class=\"unified-scene-img\" src=\"assets/scenes/scene_act6_gate03.svg\" alt=\"Sảnh chờ Cổng 03\">\n\n                        <div class=\"scene-interactive-hud\">\n                            <span style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 13px; color: #37474F;\">Vé ghi Cổng 03. Con chọn:</span>\n                            <button class=\"tycoon-btn gate-hud-btn\" data-gate=\"01\">Cổng 01</button>\n                            <button class=\"tycoon-btn gate-hud-btn\" data-gate=\"02\">Cổng 02</button>\n                            <button class=\"tycoon-btn gate-hud-btn\" data-gate=\"03\">Cổng 03 ✈️</button>\n                            <button class=\"tycoon-btn gate-hud-btn\" data-gate=\"05\">Cổng 05</button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"activity-feedback-overlay hidden\" id=\"feedback-act-6\">\n                        <span class=\"feedback-text\">Tiếp viên: “Đúng rồi! Cổng 03 đây rồi! Chào mừng Bin lên máy bay!”</span>\n                        <button class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green btn-next-activity\" data-next=\"7\">\n                            LÊN MÁY BAY ✈️ ➡️\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 CHẶNG 5 — HOẠT ĐỘNG 7: CÀI DÂY AN TOÀN (100% UNIFIED SCENE ART)\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"act-7\" class=\"activity-container\" data-act=\"7\" data-stage=\"5\">\n                <div class=\"activity-intro-view\" id=\"intro-act-7\">\n                    <span class=\"intro-header-badge\">CHẶNG 5 — HOẠT ĐỘNG 7</sp